    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest doesn't even exist here. there's no setting where i just \"step back\" and things get better. if I stop, everything crashes. it's like I'm a machine that's supposed to run forever but the gears are all grinding to a halt. sometimes i just think about what it would be like to just... not have to deal with any of it. to just have silence. to finally be free from the weight of it all. it's the only thing that feels like it would actually work.",
